  "display_title": "You Were My Summer",
  "description": "After twelve years devoted to baseball and a failed confession to his first love, Kim Min-Seong drifts through life with nothing left to chase. Hoping for a fresh start, he sets out on a cross-country bike trip, only to be stopped by monsoon rain and an accident. Stranded, he reunites with Park Hyeon-Min, his former junior from the high school baseball team, and ends up staying at his place until the weather clears. Full of awkward proximity, lingering heat, and emotions that won’t stay buried. Even when summer ends, some feelings refuse to let go.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
